 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3AQCqQb1G7wQ7kNvwHcwkSI&_nc_oc=Adpjd3Yj01Ty8LLM6xylwk2lHgbWlOL72adJ3K48nnnQJNmNDvUFEddLtqJXd0Wrxno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQbHpf7HUC7FljLmJDL8sYPxrduXtRYc4vQUDWUkUbrwg&oe=6AFDDED4"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q7qbgivsYkgQ7kNvwGxtyKV&_nc_oc=AdpXwGsi7QWBLnkO93nnBZeY-TxxJsViPpY69fL3gUZZuUOFcxYFJ98_fUfugi0aBh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNinxEq8PaLtIw3aSlCsV3xr2L7SF2Wg8x-3_jVbEX4g&oe=6AFDD51D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2uCWsN5r2hkQ7kNvwHut6NC&_nc_oc=AdrdynWiy90k6Cc7MpEbO5sfDYA8COo-XD7_bDSUJhhneOu6MQfWmj0Pe8vXaucXs0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQR2nVAkxEvnLWmtPyVCTjZtDYVGmt_FV8s-WI-c2cPw&oe=6AFDC934"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2